.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
.TH SIGMA-SH 1 "March 2026" "SigmaOS 1.0" "SigmaOS User Commands"
.SH NAME
sigma-sh \- Sovereign Zero-Trust Command Shell for SigmaOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sigma-sh
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fISCRIPT\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sigma-sh
is the native command-line shell for SigmaOS. It provides POSIX-compatible shell execution, eBPF-integrated privilege sandboxing, OpenBSD pledge/unveil integration, and Post-Quantum Cryptographic (PQC) binary execution verification.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c \ \fICOMMAND\fR
Execute
.I COMMAND
and exit immediately.
.TP
.BR \-i
Run shell in interactive mode.
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Print version information and exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sigma-pkg (8)
